  "title": "Rule: -cracy, -archy and auto-",
  "short": "-cracy and -crat mean rule or power, -archy and -arch mean rule or chief, and auto- means self.",
  "trouble": "arch can also mean first or chief (archetype, archenemy), not only rule.",
